[![NuGet](https://img.shields.io/nuget/v/Hawkynt.FileFormats.Video.svg)](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Hawkynt.FileFormats.Video/)&#xD;
[![CI](https://github.com/Hawkynt/PNGCrushCS/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?branch=main)](https://github.com/Hawkynt/PNGCrushCS/actions/workflows/ci.yml)&#xD;
